{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get ready for a bubble-bursting bonanza through time in <strong>Pang In Time</strong>! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It's like your favorite arcade classic with a time-traveling twist! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grab your trusty harpoon gun and smash those pesky bubbles as you journey through wacky worlds, from the prehistoric pang-aea, to pyramids, ancient Rome and a futuristic space station. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Bubble-Bursting Mania</strong>: Blast, pop, and ricochet your way through a kaleidoscope of crazy levels! </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Time-Traveling Shenanigans</strong>: Get warped through time and witness hilarious anachronisms \u2013 dinosaurs with jetpacks, anyone? </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Power-Up Palooza</strong>: Collect mind-bending power-ups that'll turn you into a bubble-bursting superhero! </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Friends Mayhem</strong>: Challenge your friends to be the level king! </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Pang-tastically Funny</strong>: Laugh your bubbles off with quirky characters!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Are you ready to experience the most pang-tastic, time-warping adventure of your life? Download Pang In Time now and let the bubble-bursting mayhem begin!</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"50 balloons","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3395750/5a2b451de164600b8ed98c3498b24e6a754dc07a.jpg"},{"name":"100 balloons","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3395750/1049759650935442ecf2a6bf2229970c9860a7d8.jpg"},{"name":"250 balloons","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3395750/e1ee6ed618f5d2f11d056b017e9d550b574ff42b.jpg"},{"name":"